{"3554630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "VMX", "steam_appid": 3554630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/b309f44de63c8db3124213fb2a62a87f.avif?t=1775839661\" width=1560 height=573 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/1714206511ec6437851fd6d5180e8127.avif?t=1775839661\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras_big/1714206511ec6437851fd6d5180e8127.webp?t=1775839661 width=1560 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/3544ca7ea38a412e4af1ac942bfa74a1.poster.avif?t=1775839661\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/3544ca7ea38a412e4af1ac942bfa74a1.webm?t=1775839661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/3544ca7ea38a412e4af1ac942bfa74a1.mp4?t=1775839661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VMX utilizes advanced VR controls and a custom physics system to deliver precise, true-to-life bike handling. Tricks are performed entirely through your physical gestures, creating an authentic and immersive riding experience that mirrors real life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/b89b23799d0b9c8346c308b7941adc30.avif?t=1775839661\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras_big/b89b23799d0b9c8346c308b7941adc30.webp?t=1775839661 width=1560 height=138 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/19d8c1e0ce5ddff2d7b562ea51a12e71.poster.avif?t=1775839661\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/19d8c1e0ce5ddff2d7b562ea51a12e71.webm?t=1775839661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/19d8c1e0ce5ddff2d7b562ea51a12e71.mp4?t=1775839661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VMX features a highly realistic spray painting system for vehicle customization. Simply grab a spray can in your preferred color and spray away. Beyond its true-to-life handling, the system enables smooth gradients, color blending, and custom pattern creation.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, the game features a fictional in-game store where you can spend earned points to unlock a wide range of clothing items. Choose from helmets, goggles, full-face helmets, snapbacks, beanies, and more—with even more gear coming soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/7a08863aae5a39e7e7c994bbae35a630.avif?t=1775839661\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras_big/7a08863aae5a39e7e7c994bbae35a630.webp?t=1775839661 width=1560 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/b3abacd6e26de66d1d1e6ae8f94badeb.poster.avif?t=1775839661\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/b3abacd6e26de66d1d1e6ae8f94badeb.webm?t=1775839661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/b3abacd6e26de66d1d1e6ae8f94badeb.mp4?t=1775839661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comfort Mode in VMX is designed to make the intense VR BMX experience more accessible and enjoyable for all players. With features aimed at reducing motion discomfort and creating a smoother riding experience, it lets you stay focused on exploring, practicing tricks, and having fun with greater ease and confidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/f5d555c1e16872547a59e699dcd4a7c9.avif?t=1775839661\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras_big/f5d555c1e16872547a59e699dcd4a7c9.webp?t=1775839661 width=1560 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/a7b51ff3a33a4cea82eb590f63f7fb92.poster.avif?t=1775839661\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/a7b51ff3a33a4cea82eb590f63f7fb92.webm?t=1775839661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/a7b51ff3a33a4cea82eb590f63f7fb92.mp4?t=1775839661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VMX features a multiplayer mode where you can ride with friends, explore maps together, and participate in competitive challenges. Whether you're practicing tricks in freeride sessions or competing for the best scores, multiplayer adds a new dimension to the experience.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/b309f44de63c8db3124213fb2a62a87f.avif?t=1775839661\" width=1560 height=573 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/1714206511ec6437851fd6d5180e8127.avif?t=1775839661\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras_big/1714206511ec6437851fd6d5180e8127.webp?t=1775839661 width=1560 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/3544ca7ea38a412e4af1ac942bfa74a1.poster.avif?t=1775839661\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/3544ca7ea38a412e4af1ac942bfa74a1.webm?t=1775839661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/3544ca7ea38a412e4af1ac942bfa74a1.mp4?t=1775839661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VMX utilizes advanced VR controls and a custom physics system to deliver precise, true-to-life bike handling. Tricks are performed entirely through your physical gestures, creating an authentic and immersive riding experience that mirrors real life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/b89b23799d0b9c8346c308b7941adc30.avif?t=1775839661\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras_big/b89b23799d0b9c8346c308b7941adc30.webp?t=1775839661 width=1560 height=138 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/19d8c1e0ce5ddff2d7b562ea51a12e71.poster.avif?t=1775839661\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/19d8c1e0ce5ddff2d7b562ea51a12e71.webm?t=1775839661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/19d8c1e0ce5ddff2d7b562ea51a12e71.mp4?t=1775839661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VMX features a highly realistic spray painting system for vehicle customization. Simply grab a spray can in your preferred color and spray away. Beyond its true-to-life handling, the system enables smooth gradients, color blending, and custom pattern creation.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, the game features a fictional in-game store where you can spend earned points to unlock a wide range of clothing items. Choose from helmets, goggles, full-face helmets, snapbacks, beanies, and more—with even more gear coming soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/7a08863aae5a39e7e7c994bbae35a630.avif?t=1775839661\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras_big/7a08863aae5a39e7e7c994bbae35a630.webp?t=1775839661 width=1560 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/b3abacd6e26de66d1d1e6ae8f94badeb.poster.avif?t=1775839661\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/b3abacd6e26de66d1d1e6ae8f94badeb.webm?t=1775839661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/b3abacd6e26de66d1d1e6ae8f94badeb.mp4?t=1775839661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comfort Mode in VMX is designed to make the intense VR BMX experience more accessible and enjoyable for all players. With features aimed at reducing motion discomfort and creating a smoother riding experience, it lets you stay focused on exploring, practicing tricks, and having fun with greater ease and confidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/f5d555c1e16872547a59e699dcd4a7c9.avif?t=1775839661\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras_big/f5d555c1e16872547a59e699dcd4a7c9.webp?t=1775839661 width=1560 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/a7b51ff3a33a4cea82eb590f63f7fb92.poster.avif?t=1775839661\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554630/extras/a7b51ff3a33a4cea82eb590f63f7fb92.webm?t=1775839661\"